%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Writer
  participant C as Checkpoint
  participant WAL as -wal
  participant DB as .db
  alt No reader (full 74/74)
    C->>WAL: fsync -wal
    C->>DB: copy 74f, fsync .db
    W->>WAL: restart, fsync 32B hdr
    W->>WAL: steps 8..11 (no sync)
    Note over WAL,DB: Power cut -> byte 32 (step 7)
  else Reader at step 5 (36/74)
    C->>WAL: fsync -wal
    C->>DB: copy 36f (no fsync)
    W->>WAL: steps 8..11 (same gen)
    Note over WAL,DB: Cut -> 304,912 (15 .db safe)
  end
